ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a post office of a small town, postman Xiao Zhang is sorting mail. He tells his colleague Xiao Wang, \"Today there are 50 letters to deliver, most of them are parcels, some are postcards, but there are almost no letters.\" Xiao Wang checks the mail list and finds only 12 postcards.\n\n[Question]\nAfter checking the mail list, how many parcels does Xiao Wang guess there are?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After checking the mail list, Xiao Wang guesses there are 45 parcels.\nB. After checking the mail list, Xiao Wang guesses there are 38 parcels.\nC. After checking the mail list, Xiao Wang guesses there are 15 parcels.\nD. After checking the mail list, Xiao Wang guesses there are 35 parcels.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182648943397157,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e276d6006945d280288d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368118189,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7d5925dd952f4ac9b55849b9153a6d32"}